me":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-tj.1","local_name":"sase-tj.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-tj","agent_clan_generation":"20260825081053","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-tj.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-tj[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Artifacts Agent pane — a queryable agent catalog with revival[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The Artifacts tab gains an \"Agent\" pane that catalogs every agent [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]SASE has ever named, filters it with the shared query dialect, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]resolves the `agent:` half of the artifact-link graph, and revives [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dismissed agents — with `sase agent search` giving the same catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and dialect headless.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]9[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifacts_agents_pane.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/artifacts_agents_pane.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-tj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-tj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Widen the shared boolean query dialect's value grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: teach the boolean profile dialect to spell dotted and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]digit-leading values in Python and Rust, so dates, durations, integers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and agent names are expressible at all; fixes an existing Patches [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonicalization round-trip defect.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Textual-free agent catalog row model[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog: build the registry-spined, index-enriched catalog snapshot as a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]widget-free module shared by the pane and the CLI, with a measured [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]budget.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The agents query profile[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dialect[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dialect: author agents_query_schema(), register it as a built-in pane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]profile, and add cross-language query goldens and conformance coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Feature flag, pane contract, and the mounted list[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog, dialect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane: create the disabled beta flag, register the built-in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter/descriptor before Files, and mount a snapshot-backed list that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]renders the shared shell and passes contract conformance in both flag [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]states.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Filter bar, Rust evaluation, saved queries, and history[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]query[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]query: wire the profile filter bar and ArtifactQuerySession over a Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]query index, with limit-capped presentation, facet completions, and lazy[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content gating.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Detail panel, grouping, relations, link targets, and copy[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detail[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail: add lazy agent detail, family/state grouping banners, declared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]relations plus artifact-link edges, the agent branch in link target [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution, copy targets, and marks.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Revival from the pane, with one mutation implementation[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]revive[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]revive: give the existing revive path a completion delta, make the main [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tab a consumer of it, bind revive on the pane, and reroute the R modal's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]custom search into the pane.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase agent search[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog, dialect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: ship the headless catalog search command over the same row model [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and dialect, with pretty and JSON output.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remove the flag and land the pane[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after query, detail, revive, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: delete the flag's Off branch,